# Seeded with the Lamplight fixture. The keys open over the newest reply,
# not over an older page of the transcript.
wait-for Lamplight
tap Lamplight
wait-for light.
tap Keyboard
type xyzzy
tap Run
wait-for not a verb I recognize.
tap Close keys
tap Look
wait-for pool of light.
tap Inventory
wait-for empty handed
clean
shot keys-closed
tap Keyboard
expect empty handed
clean
shot keys-open
